<BRK/>
<TXT>The audiometric testing room shall be prefabricated; approximately<MET> [1980 mm high by 2100 mm wide by 2235 mm deep inside, 2235 mm high by 2340 mm 
wide by 2440 mm deep outside,] [1980 mm high by 2100 mm wide by 2235 mm deep inside, 2235 mm high by 2740 mm wide by 2840 mm deep outside,]</MET><ENG> [78 
inches high by 84 inches wide by 88 inches deep inside, 88 inches high by 92 inches wide by 96 inches deep outside,] [78 inches high by 84 inches 
