a shelf mounted on the outer wall beneath the observation window.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Item <SUB>M-0300</SUB>, Audiometric Examination Booth</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
